# INVFAIL.KEY - a key script of INVWIN (SRC/WIN/INVWIN.C) for a link that
# does not open, run by TEST/INTEG/wintcp.sh with /TCP: to a port where
# nothing listens and to an address that does not answer, whose wait the
# host ends with Esc: the message box saying why, ENTER on it and the
# end.  Windows for Workgroups writes TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVTCPR.SNP for the
# refusal and TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVTCPC.SNP for the wait ended.
S FAILED
K ENTER
S GONE
